# 02 CI 精简方案

## 当前问题

当前 CI 拆成 backend-core、backend-a-line、backend-b-line、backend-integration、frontend，安全扫描也有重复。

## MVP CI

只留：

```text
.github/workflows/ci.yml
.github/workflows/security.yml
```

## ci.yml

```text
backend-mvp:
  install core + dev
  run tests/mvp

frontend-mvp:
  npm ci
  npm run lint
  npm run typecheck
  npm run build
```

## 手动 workflow

```text
experimental-tests.yml
docker-prod.yml
full-security.yml
```


---

# 03 前端脚本精简方案

## 当前问题

`frontend/package.json` 的 test 命令串联十几个 validate 脚本，并且 description 仍是 Lumina AI。

## 建议 scripts

```json
{
  "dev": "next dev",
  "build": "next build",
  "start": "next start",
  "lint": "eslint . --max-warnings=0",
  "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
  "test:mvp": "node scripts/validate-mvp.mjs",
  "quality:mvp": "npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm run test:mvp && npm run build"
}
```

## 归档脚本

```text
validate-i18n
validate-multisubject-routes
validate-route-cycle-fixtures
validate-route-tools
validate-version-ledger
regression-loop
supervised-window
```


---

